{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/0gL08oY9xNMTZF98aFYkDw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:22.841356+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/0gL08oY9xNMTZF98aFYkDw","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaxia0ewkG9TymDuGhnab7w28XNPtWktOxqXPqfnPRIoI2UpZfEOmt02VDdibmiaQiadFz0zHBTUCoSiaWVIzElLXbYQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span> ✦ </span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、实验室简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><span>清华大学神经调控国家工程研究中心（以下简称“研究中心”）致力于产学研医协同创新，主要研究方向包括：</span></span><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><strong><span>(1)面向先进有源植入医疗器械的</span></strong><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>应用技术研究；</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>(2)面向神经和精神疾病的</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>神经调控疗法研究；</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>(3)面向脑科学的</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>神经调控机制研究；</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>（4）面向神经调控的</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>医学人工智能方法与应用研究。</span></strong></p></section></section><section><p><span><span><span>研究中心先后成功实现</span></span><strong><span>脑起搏器、迷走神经刺激器、骶神经刺激器和脊髓刺激器</span></strong><span><span>等系列神经调控技术和产品的成果转化，在帕金森病、癫痫、膀胱过度活动症和疼痛等多种神经疾病的临床治疗中得到大量应用，相关产品累计植入患者超过4万人，覆盖900余家医院，在国内外产生了重大影响。现承担国家自然科学基金卓越研究群体等多项国家重点科研项目。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>研究中心的</span></span><strong><span>“</span></strong><strong><span>脑起搏器关键技术、系统与临床应用</span></strong><strong><span>”</span></strong><span><span>项目获2018年度</span></span><span><strong><span>国家科学技术进步奖一等奖</span></strong></span><span><span>，这是医疗器械领域的首个国家级一等奖。</span></span></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span> ✦ </span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、人才培养</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>多样化培养方案 </span></strong></p></section></section></section><p><span><span>研究中心历来非常重视人才培养，努力为学生打造基于个人学术发展兴趣的个性化、多样化的培养路径和发展平台。一方面，积极为学生聘请交叉领域的专家成为学生的副导师或联合指导教师；另一方面，研究中心同哈佛大学、牛津大学等国际顶尖高校实验室合作，选拔优秀学生前往交流学习和共同培养。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>前沿科研方向 </span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>未来学生科学研究方向包括：</span></span></p><p><span>1、有源植入医疗器械应用技术研究：先进医疗装备设计、制造技术研究，如高效充电技术、植入无线通讯技术、神经调控专用集成电路技术、高场磁共振安全性研究等；</span></p><p><span>2、神经调控疗法研究：面向帕金森病、难治性癫痫等神经精神疾病，探索变频调控、闭环控制等前沿方法，推动新一代精准神经调控疗法的创新设计与临床应用研究。</span></p><p><span>3、神经调控机制研究：研究帕金森病等疾病患者运动、睡眠、语言等功能的脑网络机制，开展帕金森病及其电刺激调控的力生物材料学研究，开展基于多模态数据的疾病机制、脑功能、新的适应症研究等。</span></p><p><span>4、面向神经调控的医学人工智能方法与应用研究：人工智能新方法驱动神经调控更智能、更有效的新方法与新应用研究。</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>宽口径就业渠道 </span></strong></p></section></section></section><p><span><span>历年来研究中心学生毕业就业方向包括：国内外高校，高科技公司，政府、事业单位，投资机构，创业等。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/iaxia0ewkG9TymDuGhnab7w28XNPtWktOxlCNmCc046XH3vcQhEdm9UAtjvJ9xAdDVvnBrtZgKQcrEX9mvptibQVw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>脑起搏器通过植入电极直接刺激大脑核团治疗帕金森病等脑疾病</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaxia0ewkG9TymDuGhnab7w28XNPtWktOxElm8eg4pZfuZ1K15ZicKShbZMD11c0cDd0oFfh0SleiaPKXhL0PRrqkg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span>实验室成果转化的系列神经调控产品</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaxia0ewkG9TymDuGhnab7w28XNPtWktOxh1UJEXuqnicCQ9T7hdPibJeKX5JZfGbDpRjy5BSdCnetegaUQp6ianXLg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span>脑起搏器项目获2018年度国家科学技术进步奖一等奖</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span> ✦ </span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、参与方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><p><strong><span>2025年7月1日-19日</span></strong><span>，为期三周。对于外地来校实习同学给予车费住宿补贴，实习完成，考核达标后实验室可提供实习证明。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span> ✦ </span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、报名条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>有志于从事有源植入医疗器械、神经调控疗法、脑科学研究的</span></span><strong><span>2022、2023级本科生（四年学制）及2021、2022级本科生（五年学制）</span></strong><span><span>。</span></span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>专业及能力要求：机械、电子、自动化、计算机、医学大类等专业，成绩优秀，动手能力强。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span> ✦ </span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、报名方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><p><span>符合条件的同学请将</span><span><strong><span>人员情况统计表（附件1）</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>个人简历</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>成绩单</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>自荐信</span></strong><span><span>和</span></span><strong><span>相关证明材料（文件夹以学校-专业-姓名命名）</span></strong><span><span>于</span></span><strong><span>6月15日前</span></strong></span><span>发送至联系人邮箱。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><strong><span>联系人：潘老师</span></strong><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span>Email：neln@tsinghua.edu.cn</span></strong></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><strong><span>人员情况统计表（附件1）</span></strong><span>可通过下方链接或点击文末</span><span><strong><span>阅读原文</span></strong></span><span>下载</span></p><p><span><span>https://cloud.tsinghua.edu.cn/f/776d626dad0e4727be08/?dl=1</span></span><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaxia0ewkG9TymDuGhnab7w28XNPtWktOxVFHpfMMNKiaPiaLRw69f2IyARJFic2dCF9xfGTP8pWURHaL7o0W92S8bw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"dbe8dc8527931474aa42d175ad6c5ef82db9e31e935d35da9f8361f34990bc75","textLength":1333,"sourceSha256":"230af42c17cf898bfb3e768f088f16318732c2599466cb017d28de7ef7bc1dbd","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-531258e6e5612d184772","title":"2026年清华大学航天航空学院神经调控国家工程研究中心暑期实习","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:22.841356+00:00"}
